# Findings of the image scan (CI job image-scan) that were looked at and accepted.
#
# The gate fails on a CRITICAL vulnerability for which a fixed version exists. An entry here lets one finding
# pass. One ID per line (CVE-…, GHSA-…), and above it a comment with: the image and package, why it does not
# apply or why it is accepted, and when to look again. Prefer fixing: a newer base image digest, a newer
# dependency (make lock), a newer Claude Code. Remove an entry as soon as the fix is in.
# See docs/development.md#image-scan.
#
